ments book karne ke liye use hota hai bina kisi human intervention ke. aage?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "\u0915\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902 \u091c\u094b"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "is ke liye LLM, speech-to-text aur text-to-speech APIs ko connect karna padta hai \u2014 jaise OpenAI aur ElevenLabs. yeh sahi?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "\u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u0928\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0905\u0917\u0930 \u0924\u094b \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u0939\u093e\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0936\u0941\u0930\u0942 \u0915\u0930\u0942\u0901 \u0914\u0930 \u0915\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u0913, \u0938\u094d\u091f\u0947\u092a \u092c\u093e\u0907, \u0938\u094d\u091f\u0947\u092a \u092c\u0924\u093e\u0913."}, {"role": "user", "content": "\u0932\u093f\u091f\u0947\u0932 \u092e\u0947\u0902"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "sabse pehle OpenAI ya kisi aur LLM ka account bana ke API key leni padegi. aage?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "\u0906\u0917\u0947 \u0924\u0942 \u092c\u0924\u093e \u092d\u093e\u0908 \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u092a\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0928\u093e"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "uske baad ek speech-to-text model chahiye jo user ki awaaz ko text mein badle, jaise Whisper.haan haan, bolo \u2014 main poora sun raha hoon."}, {"role": "user", "content": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u0941\u091b \u092c\u094b\u0932\u0940 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0901"}], "llm_response": "achha, toh wohi Whisper API ko apne code mein integrate karna hota hai taaki awaaz text mein convert ho sake. aage?", "llm_ttft_s": 0.948, "tts_first_audio_s": null, "interrupted": true, "interruption_timestamp": "2026-08-30T17:58:21.030137+00:00", "stt_provider": "groq", "stt_provider_reason": null, "turn_relation": "content", "echo_corr_score": 0.2548, "echo_shadow": {"corr": 0.2548, "text_sim": 0.531, "text_echo": false, "speech_ms": 1350.6, "ms_since_playback_end